{"reviews":[{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-0","r":5.0,"t":"It's a nice carrying case but is a bit cramped when you ...","x":"It's a nice carrying case but is a bit cramped when you put the charging cord and accessories in with the razor. It's nothing that jumping up and down on top of a few times can't take care of.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-1","r":4.0,"t":"Okay...","x":"Fits my razor great. Does not, however, have quite enough room for the extra attachments, and the power adapter.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-2","r":5.0,"t":"A must for traveling.","x":"Electric shavers are fragile. If the cutting head gets damaged and you use the shaver, it will injure you! Most shavers come with a plastic cap that snaps on over the head, but they fall off easily. This case is semi-rigid and has a padded interior. It fits the shaver closely enough to keep the cap on and has enough room inside to store the cord. I just got home from a Caribbean cruise and this case kept my shaver safe. It stood up to being tossed in a backpack and stuffed under an airplane seat","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-3","r":4.0,"t":"Nice, thick","x":"Nice, thick, protective case. The only reason that I did not give 5 stars is because my husband\u2019s Norelco does not fit properly without having to take it apart and \u201cplay Tetris\u201d with the pieces. He has the smaller shaver, so I definitely would not recommend for the bigger and thicker model.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-4","r":5.0,"t":"This rigid case does a super job of protecting the razor for which it is ...","x":"I purchased this Norelco razor case to accompany my brother's new Norelco electric razor. This rigid case does a super job of protecting the razor for which it is designed.  Norelco has been a company of long-standing reflecting the quality of its products, price point, and consumer value.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-5","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Not a perfect fit, but with some manipulation it works.  Excellent protection from rough handling.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-6","r":2.0,"t":"This case is so much bigger than the case I ...","x":"This case is so much bigger than the case I had with an earlier model.  It takes up more space when traveling than needed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great case","x":"Excellent case. My 3100 razor fits perfectly, plus gives it extra protection. I would Recommend this case.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-8","r":3.0,"t":"I use it to store my Norelco that I don't ...","x":"I use it to store my Norelco that I don't use because I still prefer to shave with a blade.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-9","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Like this carring case.  Good for traveling to protest the razor.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-10","r":3.0,"t":"otherwise I like it!","x":"Just a little tight for the cord and razor, otherwise I like it!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-11","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Be sure to not store wet, material will start to smell.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-12","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"It won't hold both the shaver and the charger.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-13","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"just fits my razorr, cord makes it real tight","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-14","r":5.0,"t":"Fits like a glove","x":"After damaging my razor's blades on one trip (how on earth that happened while in a suitcase - but airlines can destroy anything) I went looking for a case for my razor. This sounded like a good idea - rigid with an elastic band to hold the razor. And it is. If you travel a lot, this can save your razor and is a good investment.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-15","r":5.0,"t":"Neat and tidy!","x":"I bought this for my husband to keep his electric razor in. Before, if he left it out, it was just messy looking. And even when he put it in the drawer, the cord was all over and got tangled in other things. Now that he has this case to put it in, it keeps our bathroom more tidy! Who doesn't want that?","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for travel shaver.","x":"Used to store my shaver when traveling as I don't have many toiletries when traveling. Hold shaver and charging cord perfectly.  Also great for managing the loose charger when not needed in my cabinet during regular use.  Seems to be holding up well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great Protection!","x":"Now that the grandson is older, we bought him a shaver for Christmas last year.  We decided it would be nice to protect our investment, so we also got him this case.  He really likes that his shaver has a protective shell and uses it at all times.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-18","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect fit, good protection, nice spot for cord","x":"Awesome case. The shaver fits in perfectly, and the case is hard enough to protect it and keep it's shape. I love that it has a spot to put the cord, since husband misplaced it before. Now he has the perfect spot to keep everything all together.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-19","r":5.0,"t":"Good Travel Case for Norelco Shaver","x":"I purchased this for a Norelco Model 830 electric shaver.  Good protection, and held the shaver, recharging cord and cleaning brush perfectly.  The shaver (and a replacement shaver received after a warranty claim) were both lemons, however!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-20","r":5.0,"t":"Shaver case easily fits shaver and accessories for daily storage and travel","x":"Shaver case easily fits shaver and accessories for daily storage and travel.  It is compact enough to be put in a shaving kit if necessary.  The rigid structure provides some protection if accidentally dropped with shaver inside.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-21","r":4.0,"t":"2 weeks now and I do like being able to grab it any time of the ...","x":"Still In the 30 day &#34;break in your face&#34; stage.  the shaves have been getting closer with less irritation.  2 weeks now and I do like being able to grab it any time of the day and in two minutes be &#34;shaved&#34;.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-22","r":5.0,"t":"not just for razors","x":"bought this for my son to take on his trip. I used it for his hand held nebulizer. It fits his machine extra batteries and the nespules for the machine. Compact and works great and solid so it doesn't get damaged.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great case!","x":"Great little case for my new Norelco 3500 series shaver.  Fits perfectly, there's room for the charger, good solid, rigid construction.  Definitely recommend, especially for this price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B01MSMPDNH-24","r":5.0,"t":"It is sturdy enough to have survived being packed in the suitcase ...","x":"My Norelco 4500 and its charger fit perfectly into the case. It is sturdy enough to have survived being packed in the suitcase every day of my recent coach tour in Ireland.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the case too cramped for the razor plus cord and accessories, requiring manipulation to fit everything.","cites":[1,2,4,11,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the case's rigid, padded construction for protecting the razor during travel.","cites":[3,5,6,8,10,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the razor fits perfectly or like a glove.","cites":[2,8,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the case is larger than expected and takes up extra travel space.","cites":[7]},{"text":"One reviewer warns against storing the case wet because the material will start to smell.","cites":[12]}]},"qa":[]}